@host = http://localhost:5104

### Request a statement - returns 202 straight away, the job runs in the background
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/statements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "0123456789",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "from": "2026-07-01",
  "to": "2026-09-30"
}

### Check on it (watch Attempts go up when the fake mail server "fails")
GET {{host}}/api/statements/{{create.response.body.id}}

### Schedule one for later
POST {{host}}/api/statements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "0987654321",
  "email": "tunde@example.com",
  "from": "2026-09-01",
  "to": "2026-09-30",
  "deliverAt": "2026-10-28T18:00:00+01:00"
}

### Run the recurring daily report now
POST {{host}}/api/statements/daily-report/trigger
